# 1Finance App

## About the Project

1Finance App is a mobile application project designed to help users manage their personal finances.

## Features

- Track personal finances: income and expenses with a total balance
- Organize financial information: categories, search, filter by type, sort by amount
- Statistics: expenses grouped by category
- Data is saved on the device (AsyncStorage)
- Simple and user-friendly interface (Coffee Shop style design)

## Technologies Used

- React Native
- Expo
- TypeScript
- AsyncStorage

## Project Structure

```
App.tsx                      app shell: state, filters, navigation
src/types.ts                 shared types
src/constants.ts             colors, categories, seed data
src/utils.ts                 money formatting, category icons
src/storage.ts               load/save transactions
src/components/HomeHeader.tsx
src/components/TxCard.tsx
src/components/StatsView.tsx
src/components/AddModal.tsx
```

## Getting Started

### Installation

1. Clone the repository:

   git clone https://github.com/OralbaiSerzhan/1finance-app.git

2. Navigate to the project directory:

   cd 1finance-app

3. Install dependencies:

   npm install
   npx expo install @react-native-async-storage/async-storage

4. Start the application:

   npx expo start

